{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Dold–Kan 对应"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Dold–Kan对应"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Dold–Kan 对应是某些"},{"Local":{"url":"链复形","text":"链复形"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯集","text":"单纯"}},{"Plain":" Abel 群之间的等价.</p>\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<h3>1-范畴版本</h3>\n<p>Abel 单纯群等价于连合的 Abel 群链复形:\n$$\r\nN \\colon  \\mathsf {sAb} \\rightleftarrows \\mathsf {Ch}^+(\\mathsf {Ab})\\colon \\Gamma,\r\n$$\n其中 $N$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Moore复形","text":"Moore 复形"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>∞–范畴版本</h3>\n<p>设 $\\mathcal C$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定∞-范畴","text":"稳定无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":", 则有等价\n$$\r\n\\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathbb{Z}_{\\geq 0},\\mathcal C) \\simeq\\mathsf {Fun}(\\Delta^{\\text{op}},\\mathcal C).\r\n$$\n这个等价与同伦范畴的 Dold–Kan 对应 $\\mathsf {Ch}(h\\mathcal C)_{\\geq 0}\\simeq \\mathsf {Fun}(\\Delta^{\\text{op}},h\\mathcal C)$ 相容.</p>\n<p>借助 Dold–Kan 对应, 可由"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯对象","text":"单纯对象"}},{"Plain":"构造"},{"Local":{"url":"谱序列","text":"谱序列"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}